08:14.155 --> 08:15.568
to give me their money?
把他们的钱给我？

08:15.637 --> 08:17.189
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

08:18.982 --> 08:20.431
[straining]
[紧张]

08:20.500 --> 08:22.568
I'm okay!
我没事！

08:22.637 --> 08:24.155
- Well...?
- 出色地...？

08:24.224 --> 08:26.534
- What's the point?
There's no one in the kitchen
- 有什么意义？
厨房里没人

08:26.603 --> 08:28.775
to make any food.
制作任何食物。

08:28.844 --> 08:31.982
- Hm? Hm, huh, eh, ah.
- 嗯？嗯嗯嗯嗯。

08:32.051 --> 08:34.120
[high-pitched] What!
Where's SpongeBob?
[高声调]什么！
海绵宝宝在哪里？

08:34.189 --> 08:36.017
Didn't he call in?
他没打电话过来吗？

08:38.534 --> 08:40.913
- Hey Mr. Krabs,
it's me, SpongeBob.
- 嘿，蟹老板，
是我，海绵宝宝。

08:40.982 --> 08:42.706
Um, I'm in jail.
嗯，我在监狱里。

08:42.775 --> 08:44.948
In Bubbletown.
They gave me--
在泡泡镇。
他们给了我——

08:45.017 --> 08:46.741
- Oh, barnacles.
- 哦，藤壶。

08:46.810 --> 08:48.879
Me fry cook's in the clink.
我用叮叮当当的方式炒厨师。

08:48.948 --> 08:50.948
You have the conn,
Mr. Squidward.
你有连接，
章鱼哥先生。

08:51.017 --> 08:53.534
I'll be back as soon
as I can!
我会尽快回来
尽我所能！

08:53.603 --> 08:55.465
- Wha--
- Whoa.
- 什--
- 哇哦。

08:55.534 --> 08:56.741
[dreadful music]
[可怕的音乐]

08:56.810 --> 08:59.500
- [straining]
- [紧张]

09:00.431 --> 09:01.810
[stealthy jazz music]
[隐秘的爵士乐]

09:01.879 --> 09:03.913
[cheering]
[欢呼]

09:03.982 --> 09:05.293
- [laughing]
- [笑]

09:05.362 --> 09:07.879
- Mr. Krabs!
- [grunts]
- 蟹老板！
- [咕哝]

09:07.948 --> 09:10.775
This is a prison break, boy-o.
Let's get a move on!
这是越狱，男孩。
让我们继续前进吧！

09:10.844 --> 09:12.913
We've got a bunch
of hungry customers back home,
我们有一堆
饥饿的顾客回到家，

09:12.982 --> 09:14.327
and I need your help fleecing--
我需要你的帮助来诈骗——

09:14.396 --> 09:16.224
I mean, I mean
feeding them!
我是说，我是说
喂他们！

09:16.293 --> 09:18.672
- Oh, I'm sorry, Mr. Krabs.
I can't go.
- 哦，对不起，蟹老板。
我不能去。

09:18.741 --> 09:21.844
I haven't finished paying
my debt to society yet.
我还没付完钱
我对社会的亏欠还没有。

09:21.913 --> 09:23.982
- [stammering]
Can't go?
- [结巴]
不能去吗？

09:24.051 --> 09:25.982
When I say we're leaving,
当我说我们要离开时

09:26.051 --> 09:27.431
we're leaving!
我们要走了！

09:27.500 --> 09:30.224
- Hey! You're not supposed
to be in here!
- 嘿！你不应该
来到这里！

09:30.293 --> 09:32.086
- Eat claw, bubble cop!
- 吃爪子吧，泡泡警察！

09:32.155 --> 09:35.224
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

09:36.258 --> 09:39.051
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

09:39.120 --> 09:40.741
- Uh--huh?
- 呃-嗯？

09:40.810 --> 09:42.500
[gasps, screams]
[喘气，尖叫]

09:44.741 --> 09:47.741
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

09:52.017 --> 09:53.706
- Honey!
- 蜂蜜！

09:54.155 --> 09:56.706
[claw propellers whirring]
[爪形螺旋桨呼呼作响]

09:57.637 --> 10:00.051
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

10:00.120 --> 10:02.396
[bubble ducks quacking]
[泡泡鸭嘎嘎叫]

10:03.672 --> 10:05.465
- [sighing]
- [叹气]

10:05.534 --> 10:08.327
Good thing they were
all just bubbles, eh?
还好他们是
一切都只是泡沫，是吗？

10:08.396 --> 10:10.810
Okay, let's get out of here.
好吧，我们离开这里吧。

10:10.879 --> 10:12.534
Uh-oh.
呃哦。

10:13.362 --> 10:15.051
- You popped it all.
- 你把它全部弹出了。

10:15.120 --> 10:17.155
There's nothing left.
什么都没有剩下了。

10:17.224 --> 10:18.706
- Forget it, SpongeBob.
- 算了，海绵宝宝。

10:18.775 --> 10:20.120
It's Bubbletown.
这是泡泡镇。

10:20.189 --> 10:23.258
- No!
I can't forget it.
- 不！
我无法忘记它。

10:23.327 --> 10:25.568
Just leave me here, Mr. Krabs.
蟹老板，把我留在这里吧。

10:25.637 --> 10:27.879
My tears will be
a fitting memorial
我的泪水将会
一个合适的纪念馆

10:27.948 --> 10:29.948
to the bubble city
that I loved.
到泡泡城
我所爱的。

10:30.017 --> 10:31.534
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

10:31.603 --> 10:34.879
- So sorry to interrupt,
but I might have a solution
- 很抱歉打扰，
但我可能有一个解决方案

10:34.948 --> 10:36.982
that works for everyone!
这对每个人都有效！

10:37.051 --> 10:40.431
- [gasps]
Oh, yeah!
- [喘气]
哦，是啊！

10:40.500 --> 10:42.017
- Yeah.
- 是的。

10:43.189 --> 10:45.879
- Let's blow
this popsicle stand.
- 让我们吹吧
这个冰棍架

10:45.948 --> 10:48.603
[laughs]
[笑]

10:48.672 --> 10:51.603
[bright music]
[明亮的音乐]

10:51.672 --> 10:54.362
[chattering, laughing]
[闲聊、大笑]

10:54.431 --> 10:57.810
- I can't believe
how quickly you inflated
- 我不敢相信
你充气的速度有多快

10:57.879 --> 11:00.086
the whole city again,
SpongeBob!
整个城市再次
海绵宝宝！

11:00.155 --> 11:02.120
- Yep! The whole city.
- 是的！整个城市。

11:02.189 --> 11:04.258
Plus this new Krusty Krab.
再加上这个新的蟹堡王。

11:04.327 --> 11:06.500
- [laughing] Yeah.
- [笑] 是的。

11:06.568 --> 11:09.706
Franchisin's a great idea,
boy-o!
特许经营是个好主意
男孩哦！

11:09.775 --> 11:13.293
I am making money
claw over fist here.
我正在赚钱
这里用爪子捂住拳头。

11:13.362 --> 11:16.672
Hey, what's the exchange rate
for bubbles to real money?
你好，汇率是多少
为了泡沫到真金白银？

11:16.741 --> 11:18.155
- There is none!
- 没有！

11:18.224 --> 11:20.155
[both laugh]
[两人都笑了]

11:20.224 --> 11:21.879
[all laugh]
[全都笑]

11:21.948 --> 11:23.534
- Exchange rate?
- 汇率？

11:23.603 --> 11:24.948
[laughing]
[笑]

11:25.017 --> 11:26.741
- That's it.
We're done here.
- 就是这样。
我们到这里就完成了。

11:26.810 --> 11:28.051
[loud pop]
[爆裂声]

11:28.120 --> 11:29.948
- Huh.
[giggles]
- 嗯。
[咯咯笑]

11:30.017 --> 11:31.810
[bubble ducks quacking]
[泡泡鸭嘎嘎叫]

11:31.879 --> 11:34.155
- I "wuv" to learn!
- 我“wuv”来学习！

- 我“wuv”来学习！